      "value": "Updated the world by adding a single button to press all the other buttons. Clicking it and having someone else joins results in 96 of them being deferred (Showing 1 in the right side of the screenshot below) and the rest (160 other triggers) simply being ignored by not buffering the trigger at all. So... if your world has more than 96 buffered triggers, late joiners are guaranteed to not be synced!",
